menu "Mifare reader (NZ3801 / MFRC522)"

    config MIFARE_BENCH_MODULE
        bool "Bench RC522-clone module antenna workaround"
        default n
        help
            The OEM idle-burst antenna config (TxControlReg=0x03, TX1+TX2
            without InvTx2) does NOT excite cards on RC522-clone Arduino
            bench modules (A/B proven 2026-08-06: mifare_poll_fail.txt vs
            mifare_poll_works.txt). This is a bench-module antenna artifact,
            not a silicon difference.

            Enable ONLY for bench bring-up with such modules: the idle burst
            then uses InvTx2RFOn (0x83) so burst/poll detection works.

            For the ES242F lock-board port leave this DISABLED — the lock's
            NZ3801 antenna network works with the OEM value 0x03 (parity).

            Equivalent legacy override: -DCMAKE_C_FLAGS=-DMIFARE_BENCH_MODULE=1

endmenu
